{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 1117397394252857744,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The Zen of Python",
      "source_hash": 787207663057468596,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "파이썬의 선(禪)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T16:59:49.659043Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 9351792409054324088,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T16:59:49.659046Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Long time Pythoneer Tim Peters succinctly channels the BDFL's guiding principles for Python's design into 20 aphorisms, only 19 of which have been written down.",
      "source_hash": 6517037332209181226,
      "context_hash": 411333918504770236,
      "translation": "오랜 기간 활동해 온 파이썬 애호가(Pythoneer) Tim Peters는 파이썬 설계에 대한 BDFL의 지침 원칙을 20개의 경구로 간결하게 담아냈지만, 그중 19개만 기록되어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T16:59:49.659046Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The Zen of Python",
      "source_hash": 787207663057468596,
      "context_hash": 8311363429907253779,
      "translation": "파이썬의 선",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:18.646318Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Beautiful is better than ugly.",
      "source_hash": 13587099965876235283,
      "context_hash": 8790101369146027133,
      "translation": "추한 것보다는 아름다운 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605446Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Explicit is better than implicit.",
      "source_hash": 5131717256391263937,
      "context_hash": 4514966745106370405,
      "translation": "암시적인 것보다는 명시적인 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605448Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Simple is better than complex.",
      "source_hash": 13398584157713073036,
      "context_hash": 4818338116469325000,
      "translation": "복잡한 것보다는 단순한 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Complex is better than complicated.",
      "source_hash": 14986566675242630867,
      "context_hash": 6196203777741547951,
      "translation": "뒤얽힌 것보다는 복잡한 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:4",
      "source": "Flat is better than nested.",
      "source_hash": 9655038307541270599,
      "context_hash": 5979807109486897038,
      "translation": "중첩된 것보다는 평평한 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:5",
      "source": "Sparse is better than dense.",
      "source_hash": 14589523516924548007,
      "context_hash": 12642689427191605887,
      "translation": "밀집한 것보다는 성긴 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:6",
      "source": "Readability counts.",
      "source_hash": 16776827048071142063,
      "context_hash": 6685478380454870040,
      "translation": "가독성이 중요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605449Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:7",
      "source": "Special cases aren't special enough to break the rules.",
      "source_hash": 11085412669464582867,
      "context_hash": 15763481983324519360,
      "translation": "특별한 경우라 해도 규칙을 깰 만큼 특별하지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:8",
      "source": "Although practicality beats purity.",
      "source_hash": 5332067474809569408,
      "context_hash": 16197222425304192143,
      "translation": "다만 실용성이 순수성을 이깁니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:9",
      "source": "Errors should never pass silently.",
      "source_hash": 9960461205687100481,
      "context_hash": 13778703492366525763,
      "translation": "오류는 결코 조용히 넘어가서는 안 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:10",
      "source": "Unless explicitly silenced.",
      "source_hash": 177429040445735564,
      "context_hash": 451102626162640241,
      "translation": "명시적으로 무시하지 않는 한 그렇습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:11",
      "source": "In the face of ambiguity, refuse the temptation to guess.",
      "source_hash": 7243239490307553426,
      "context_hash": 1383344105805397314,
      "translation": "모호함에 직면했을 때, 추측하려는 유혹을 거부하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:12",
      "source": "There should be one-- and preferably only one --obvious way to do it.",
      "source_hash": 6114627297556141175,
      "context_hash": 8843510404798579933,
      "translation": "무언가를 하는 명백한 방법은 하나—가급적 단 하나만—있어야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605450Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:13",
      "source": "Although that way may not be obvious at first unless you're Dutch.",
      "source_hash": 8741989642773253316,
      "context_hash": 7628346989086697023,
      "translation": "다만 네덜란드인이 아니라면 처음에는 그 방법이 명백하지 않을 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:14",
      "source": "Now is better than never.",
      "source_hash": 9627047453074610510,
      "context_hash": 560041681593285820,
      "translation": "아예 하지 않는 것보다는 지금 하는 것이 낫습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:15",
      "source": "Although never is often better than *right* now.",
      "source_hash": 9355815017673591047,
      "context_hash": 5596171828854114318,
      "translation": "다만 지금 *당장* 하는 것보다는 아예 하지 않는 것이 나은 경우가 많습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:16",
      "source": "If the implementation is hard to explain, it's a bad idea.",
      "source_hash": 8706641915330814319,
      "context_hash": 13823866935598512416,
      "translation": "구현을 설명하기 어렵다면, 그것은 나쁜 아이디어입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:17",
      "source": "If the implementation is easy to explain, it may be a good idea.",
      "source_hash": 9955610592269212024,
      "context_hash": 6711287099940124697,
      "translation": "구현을 설명하기 쉽다면, 그것은 좋은 아이디어일 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605451Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:18",
      "source": "Namespaces are one honking great idea -- let's do more of those!",
      "source_hash": 879950915861574191,
      "context_hash": 9154692422971780447,
      "translation": "네임스페이스는 정말 멋진 아이디어입니다—그런 것을 더 많이 만듭시다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:33.605452Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Easter Egg",
      "source_hash": 113348418040389020,
      "context_hash": 4838495379618463270,
      "translation": "이스터 에그",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:01:18.456800Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References",
      "source_hash": 17861670083855418992,
      "context_hash": 15422173715741673009,
      "translation": "참고 문헌",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T16:59:49.659047Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Originally posted to comp.lang.python/python-list@python.org under a thread called `\"The Way of Python\" <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/comp.lang.python/B_VxeTBClM0/L8W9KlsiriUJ>`__",
      "source_hash": 14165094257205951190,
      "context_hash": 17234654785806853987,
      "translation": "원래 comp.lang.python/python-list@python.org 에 `\"The Way of Python\" <https://groups.google.com/d/msg/comp.lang.python/B_VxeTBClM0/L8W9KlsiriUJ>`__\\ 라는 제목의 스레드로 게시되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T16:59:49.659048Z",
      "issues": []
    }
  ]
}